{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Hiya!\" She holds out a black talon-like hand. \"Irynx is indeed the name. Priestess of Thought, among other titles.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:17:12.737000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870324089334693898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Liza sheaks the hand. \"Nice to meet ya, name's Liz Beckett, officially. But I'm looking to fix that. I've heard you can perform an annullment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:18:28.496000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870324407090937926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"She doesn't seem to be very focused on you, and her eyes, as well as the heads of both her ravens, just keep scanning the deck for something.\n\n\"I can make it sound really official,\" she nods absently.","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:19:19.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870324619675062292","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Good enough.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:19:31.941000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870324673198575626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Looking for someone?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:19:52.709000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870324760305872956","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Something,\" she turns her head back to Liz. \"A corpse. High elf, punchable face. Details might be pointless if his body was torn apart, but I don't really think you keep stock of dead bodies on this here ship.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:21:32.501000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870325178863870034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
