{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Oh!\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:36:57.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329058691514409","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Oh, that would be why.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:37:06.430000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329096046014494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"If he used this face ever, then you'd see the resemblance.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:37:21.420000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329158918623293","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"She shifts back.","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:37:29.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329193844596788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Oh, you mean he's one too?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:37:38.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329231438135306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"More than one changeling in a family. That's so cool.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:37:56.444000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329305819930645","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"It happens.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:38:23.123000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329417719750696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Also some people think that changelings work like ferns.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:38:44.428000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T15:38:51.722000Z","id":"870329507079409664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"How do ferns work?'","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:39:09.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329612104765470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"They split a small piece of themselves off that grows into a new fern.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:39:41.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870329747811467305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"And... *is* that how changelings work?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:40:53.561000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870330048702472212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"No. We work the same as all humanoids. We're just a little *flexible*.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:41:38.159000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870330235760029756","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Again, the more you know!\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:43:13.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870330634562842675","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"The ravens on her shoulder snap back to look forward. \"Well, it seems I won't find what I'm looking for here. It was nice meeting you, Miss Beckett. And have a nice day, the both of you!\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:44:09.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870330869250924614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
